  "description": "Starts a new thread on the harness you meant to use, not the one the last thread left behind. Four buttons in the New thread composer apply a saved provider, model, and reasoning level in one click. A settings editor builds the buttons from BB's live provider catalogue, so no JSON and no reload. The strip holds one row beside the project picker and never wraps.",
